[00:28.040]Everything will change one day
{"终有一天万物都会改变"}
[00:29.380]Every moment's gonna fade
{"每个瞬间终将消逝"}
[00:30.730]Blurring all the memories
{"模糊了所有回忆"}
[00:33.900]Telling me nobody can
{"告诉我无人能够"}
[00:34.990]Love forever, back today
{"让爱永恒 重回今日"}
[00:36.760]I'll overcome my fear
{"我会战胜心中恐惧"}
[00:38.850]Give me the green light
{"请给我通行绿灯"}
[00:40.140]You are everything to me
{"你是我的一切意义"}
[00:41.700]It's true, it's true, it's true
{"这是真的 千真万确"}
[00:44.440]Give me the green light
{"请给我通行绿灯"}
[00:45.900]You're the only one I see
{"你是我唯一的风景"}
[00:47.380]I do, I do, I do
{"我愿意 心甘情愿"}
[00:49.460]You make me feel alive
{"你让我重获生机"}
[00:52.330]You make me feel alright
{"你让我感觉安心"}
